  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep veggies: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line 2 oven trays with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled sweet potato (see Cooking tip) and eggplant into 2cm-thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474777/photos/large/76099_1-0915b740920aed6d04f2053c93afea6f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season veggies: Put the veggies on a lined tray and drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil. Scatter with 1½ tsp harissa seasoning (see Make it yours) and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474778/photos/large/76099_2-d6554f8856bc8c8955d16785af4b97e4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake tortilla chips: Quarter the tortillas and put on the remaining lined tray. Bake the tortillas on the upper oven shelf and the veggies on the lower shelf, turning halfway, for 20-25 mins until the veggies are tender and the tortillas are golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474779/photos/large/76099_3-811af657f2b0e4abde81621b3cab8ee1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make harissa oil: Meanwhile, cut the lemon into wedges. Cut the vegan feta into cubes. Combine 1 tsp harissa seasoning and 1 tbs olive oil in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474780/photos/large/76099_4-2b5ddf24a20930d20e84b1754728931d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Arrange the roast veggies, tortilla chips, vegan feta and hummus on a platter. Drizzle the hummus and vegan feta with the harissa oil and serve with the lemon wedges for squeezing over. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474781/photos/large/76099_5-fff2ab28bbc0556d32418279f28db63c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Our harissa seasoning has a chilli kick, so you might like to add a little more or less to taste, depending on your palate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/474782/photos/large/76099_6-d6b1611c910744310dadb63bf0b8f5e0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
